      "side": 1,
      "message": "`std::string_view` is not guaranteed to be null-terminated. Using `%s` with `data()` here is unsafe and can cause crashes or garbage output. \n\nUse `%.*s` and pass the size, or convert to `std::string`:\n```cpp\nreturn base::StringPrintf(\"Expected:\\n%.*s\\nActual:\\n%.*s\", \n                           static_cast\u003cint\u003e(expected.size()), expected.data(),\n                           static_cast\u003cint\u003e(actual.size()), actual.data());\n```",
